Part F: Encapsulation & Important Concept
Q34. How does a TCP segment fit into an Ethernet frame?

TCP segment sits inside the IP datagram payload.

IP datagram sits inside the Ethernet payload.

Order: Ethernet Header → IP Header → TCP Header → Payload → CRC.

Q35. What is the IP MTU / Ethernet payload?

1500 bytes — the maximum IP datagram that can fit in an Ethernet frame.

